<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Demosthenes (general)</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/413-bce">413 BCE</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/5th-century-bce">5th century BCE</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/demosthenes">Demosthenes</a> was an Athenian general of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peloponnesian-war">Peloponnesian War</a>. In 426 BCE he defeated the Ambraciots at Olpae and Idomene in north-western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/greece">Greece</a>, and in 425 BCE he fortified Pylos, leading to the capture of Spartan troops on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-sphacteria">Sphacteria</a>. Sent to reinforce the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sicilian-expedition">Sicilian Expedition</a>, he was captured with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nicias">Nicias</a> and executed at Syracuse in 413 BCE.</p></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>Athens, urged on by <b>Demosthenes</b>, joined Thebes against Philip II of Macedon and was defeated at the Battle of Chaeronea in 338 BCE; Philip treated the city leniently, and it joined his League of Corinth.</blockquote><a href="/empire/athens">Athens · Decline &amp; Fall</a></li><li><blockquote>In the Peloponnesian War it fought the Acarnanians and Amphilochian Argos, and in 426 BCE the Athenian general <b>Demosthenes</b> destroyed its army at Idomene.</blockquote><a href="/state/ambracia">Ambracia</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Aphidna, in what is now <a href="/countries/greece">Greece</a>. Died in Syracuse, in what is now <a href="/countries/italy">Italy</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=38.19,23.88&amp;year=-423" aria-label="Aphidna on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="5144 792 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Demosthenes (general)"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5594 1062h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5594 1062h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=38.19,23.88&amp;year=-423">What was here in 423 BCE? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
